set.body:
Add an identity-bound FeatureRestriction and RestrictedFrameTransform over the existing Op and FunctionalFrame core.

Expose distinct PartialScorePolicy cases for direct contribution and regularized least-squares score recovery. Restriction must carry the restricted feature space, embedding, fitted preprocessor, restricted frame, and source identities. Gale QR or SPD solves must be used instead of explicit Gram inversion.

Acceptance:
- selecting every feature equals full FittedFrameTransform.project;
- contribution and least-squares formulas match independent dense oracles;
- restriction commutes with fitted preprocessing and rejects foreign or reordered feature identity;
- single-feature, rank-deficient, permuted, sparse, and lazy-affine cases are tested;
- PCA, PLSC, CCA, and RRR expose the capability without method-specific projection engines;
- JVM and Scala.js pass.
